  (text "PROTECTION\n- Relay K401 (NO contacts) connects the jacks only when RDRV is high: ~2-3 s after power-up (220k / 10u),\n  released at once if +18V4 sags (U406A), -16V collapses (U406B), either output has DC beyond about\n  +-0.6 V (Q402 / Q403), or the XMOS pulls HP_EN low (BAT54 D402)."
